sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Platform Ingress<br/>(KServe/Istio)
    participant MM as ModelMesh Sidecar<br/>Pod-local
    participant GRPC as RuntimeGRPCServer<br/>TCP Port (TLS/mTLS)
    participant UDS as RuntimeGRPCServer<br/>Unix Domain Socket
    participant Wrapper as CaikitRuntimeServerWrapper<br/>(Request Interception)
    participant Predict as GlobalPredictServicer
    participant MgrMgr as ModelManager<br/>(Singleton Cache)
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(Dir/ZIP/Bytes)
    participant Metrics as Prometheus Metrics<br/>Server

    Note over Client,Metrics: Inference Flow (External Client)
    Client->>GW: gRPC Inference Request<br/>TLS 1.3
    GW->>GRPC: Forward Request<br/>TLS/mTLS (configurable)
    GRPC->>Wrapper: Intercept Request
    Wrapper->>Predict: GlobalPredictServicer
    Predict->>MgrMgr: Get/Load Model
    MgrMgr->>MgrMgr: Check Singleton Cache<br/>(Thread-Safe Lock)
    alt Model Not Cached
        MgrMgr->>Storage: Load Model Artifacts
        Storage-->>MgrMgr: Model Data
        MgrMgr->>MgrMgr: Cache Model (Singleton)
    end
    Predict-->>Wrapper: Prediction Result
    Wrapper-->>GRPC: Response
    GRPC-->>GW: gRPC Response
    GW-->>Client: Inference Result

    Note over MM,UDS: ModelMesh Sidecar Flow (Pod-local)
    MM->>UDS: mmesh.ModelRuntime/loadModel<br/>Unix Domain Socket (insecure)
    UDS->>MgrMgr: Load Model
    MgrMgr->>Storage: Fetch Model Artifacts
    Storage-->>MgrMgr: Model Data
    MgrMgr-->>UDS: Load Result
    UDS-->>MM: Model Loaded

    MM->>UDS: mmesh.ModelRuntime/runtimeStatus<br/>Unix Domain Socket
    UDS-->>MM: Runtime Status Response

    MM->>UDS: mmesh.ModelRuntime/unloadModel<br/>Unix Domain Socket
    UDS->>MgrMgr: Unload Model
    MgrMgr-->>UDS: Unload Result
    UDS-->>MM: Model Unloaded

    Note over GRPC,Metrics: Training Flow
    Client->>GRPC: Training Request<br/>TLS/mTLS
    GRPC->>Wrapper: Intercept Request
    Wrapper->>MgrMgr: Train Model
    MgrMgr->>MgrMgr: Delegate to ModelTrainerBase
    MgrMgr-->>Wrapper: Training Result
    Wrapper-->>GRPC: Response
    GRPC-->>Client: Training Complete

    Note over Metrics,Metrics: Metrics Collection
    GRPC->>Metrics: PromServerInterceptor<br/>(py-grpc-prometheus)
    Metrics-->>Metrics: Expose /metrics endpoint
